-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §43 ההמרה: the pay of an existing academic
-- teacher who moves to the new structure of parts ו–ז is converted, as
-- §§44–50 set out.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `43 ההמרה`

@ref akn:art_43
GIVEN `an existing teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `an academic teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `moves to the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the pay is converted under part ח` `an existing teacher` `an academic teacher` `moves to the reform` IF
    `an existing teacher` AND `an academic teacher` AND `moves to the reform`

-- akn:art_43/p2 The heading of §44 ("נוסחת ההמרה"), printed at the foot of §43; no rule.

#ASSERT `the pay is converted under part ח` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the pay is converted under part ח` FALSE TRUE TRUE
